      "anchor_id": "issue-gothrumedia-villume-admin-1766",
      "display_title": "Issue #1766: Move Send Feedback from the side menu to the header, open in a new tab",
      "main_description_html": "<h2 dir=\"auto\">Problem</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Send Feedback sits in the dashboard side menu, where it is easy to miss. Clicking it also navigates the current page away to the contact form — in the editor that means losing the gallery you were working on just to report something about it.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">What changes</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Move the button to the header.</strong> Send Feedback becomes an icon button in the top-right of the header, directly to the left of the theme toggle, styled the same as the theme toggle. Hovering it shows a \"Send Feedback\" tooltip.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Remove it from the side menu.</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Show it only where it belongs.</strong> The button appears only for signed-in users on dashboard pages. On the landing page it is hidden, signed in or not.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Open the contact form in a new tab.</strong> Clicking Send Feedback opens the contact form in a new tab instead of leaving the current page. The form arrives pre-filled exactly as it does today — subject \"Beta Feedback\" and a note about the page the feedback came from.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>The editor keeps its own Send Feedback button</strong> in the editor toolbar, unchanged in position, and it also opens in a new tab now. The gallery you are editing stays open behind it.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Done when</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Feedback button is in the header, left of the theme toggle, same look, with a \"Send Feedback\" tooltip</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Feedback entry is gone from the side menu</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Button visible on dashboard pages when signed in; hidden on landing</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Clicking it opens a new tab with the contact form pre-filled</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Editor feedback button opens a new tab and leaves the editor session intact</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Demo by Developer</h2>\n<details open=\"\" class=\"details-reset border rounded-2\">\n  <summary class=\"tmp-px-3 py-2\">\n    <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-component=\"Octicon\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" data-view-component=\"true\" class=\"octicon octicon-device-camera-video\">\n    <path d=\"M16 3.75v8.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.136.643L11 10.575v.675A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 9.25 13h-7.5A1.75 1.75 0 0 1 0 11.25v-6.5C0 3.784.784 3 1.75 3h7.5c.966 0 1.75.784 1.75 1.75v.675l3.864-2.318A.75.75 0 0 1 16 3.75Zm-6.5 1a.25.25 0 0 0-.25-.25h-7.5a.25.25 0 0 0-.25.25v6.5c0 .138.112.25.25.25h7.5a.25.25 0 0 0 .25-.25v-6.5ZM11 8.825l3.5 2.1v-5.85l-3.5 2.1Z\"></path>\n</svg>\n    <span class=\"m-1\">2026-08-06.15-52-11.mp4</span>\n    <span class=\"dropdown-caret\"></span>\n  </summary>\n\n  <video src=\"videos/video-7854c0fa-21cc-4b6b-8ad8-99900ea8df04.mp4\" data-canonical-src=\"videos/video-7854c0fa-21cc-4b6b-8ad8-99900ea8df04.mp4\" controls=\"controls\" muted=\"muted\" class=\"d-block rounded-bottom-2 border-top width-fit\" style=\"max-height:640px; min-height: 200px\">\n\n  </video>\n</details>\n",
